# Code owners for sensitive paths only.
#
# There is deliberately NO `*` default owner. Ordinary PRs are not
# auto-assigned a reviewer — the author requests @VerifyYou/dev-team on the
# PR, and team code-review auto-assignment fans that single request out to
# the individual members, which is what populates each member's Linear
# "Needs your review" queue. See VY-359.
#
# Because there is no default owner, enabling "require review from Code
# Owners" costs nothing on ordinary PRs: a file with no owner needs no
# code-owner approval. It binds only on the paths below.
#
# NOTE: a team is only a valid code owner if it is visible AND has write
# access to this repo — org base permission does not count, and an invalid
# entry is silently ignored (the file looks correct and requests nobody).
# @VerifyYou/code-admins was granted write on 2026-08-06; do not remove it.
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @VerifyYou/code-admins
/.github/workflows/     @VerifyYou/code-admins
